      "comments": [
        {
          "commentId": "b5a6d49a-061f-4e28-ab10-88fe33107ab0",
          "text": "Barth’s complaint is that, having started well by asserting the divine origin of\nScripture, these theologians allowed rationalism to creep into their biblical exposition and\ntheology, for want of effectively thinking through the doctrine of the Spirit as Lord of,\nand instructor through, the written word. Since Barth’s own doctrine of Scripture makes\nits divine origin wholly problematical, and his theological interpretations of it seem again\nand again to be read into the text rather than read out of it, one is tempted simply to retort\n‘physician, heal thyself’, and leave the matter there—but the criticism is a serious one,\nmade in good faith, and if it is valid as a stricture on Owen, who, whatever else he is, is\ncertainly a mainstream Reformed divine, it would certainly limit the extent to which we\ncould look to him for help today.\n\n对于这一段，我看得比较糊涂。\n\nKarl Barth 的观点，是不是说，他认为圣经的解释不能引入理性，圣灵是圣经的作者，我们想读懂圣经，就必须完全靠圣灵来教导我们？\n\n后面又提到“可是，巴特自己的圣经论使圣经的神圣来源变得完全成问题；他的神学解释也似乎一再是读进经文，而不是从经文读出来。” 我从这里猜测 Karl Barth 是反对正统神学中，使用理性来理解、提取圣经中的教义的。他的圣经论具体是什么，有什么问题？请你在网上查询 Karl Barth 的圣经论相关的说法。\n也许，可以像原译者一样，你也可以为此添加一个“译者注”。\n\n从上下文，“事实上，我们将发现，巴特的批评完全不适用于欧文；巴特认为欧文那一代人最薄弱的地方，恰恰是欧文最为精通的领域。” 可能也证实了我的猜测，巴特批评正统神学家“冻结”在圣经中，但欧文在论及圣灵和圣经的关系方面，绝对不会被巴特打倒。",
          "status": "resolved",
          "createdAt": "2026-09-05T23:23:07.649Z",
          "resolvedAt": "2026-09-06T01:00:56.878Z"
        }
      ]
    },
