        {
          "commentId": "1c3bd4f7-0636-4082-bb23-008d968faa1f",
          "text": "So he writes: ‘the Holy Ghost speaking in and by the\nword imparting to it virtue, power, efficacy, majesty, and authority, affords us the\nwitness, that our faith is resolved into’.\n\n原文中这句话很长，也比较拗口，可以尝试拆分成几个分句，来翻译，以便能够更容易理解。特别是比如，“the Holy Ghost speaking in and by the\nword”  翻译为 “圣灵在神的话中并藉着神的话说话” 本身是可以的，但是用中文读起来，理解起来有些困难。",
          "status": "resolved",
          "createdAt": "2026-09-06T00:24:15.838Z",
          "resolvedAt": "2026-09-06T01:00:56.878Z"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pairId": "c5e1524a-2685-5cb7-9811-ae0a7e456178",
      "sourceBlockId": "10787f4a-bab0-52f9-b9c2-6c6c0576b69a",
      "targetBlockId": "780ed4a6-3407-5e8d-91e3-2397963eb03b",
      "sourceContentHash": "5071c8c89627b7eccf8cee80bfcf689f7346be949d841bf7bd02d78937786f29",
      "targetContentHash": "5a909aba19db4837de955d9075f6dbb329baeb4d2867910e3ca3658dfdcab494",
      "status": "approved",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-09-06T05:59:31.854Z",
      "approvedAt": "2026-09-06T05:59:31.854Z",
      "comments": [
        {
          "commentId": "d83c9d74-af4e-4d9b-a14b-3c1900feaf7f",
          "text": "‘Must we not rest at last in that to theion [divine quality], which\naccompanies the true voice of God, evidencing itself and ascertaining the soul beyond all\npossibility of mistake?’\n\n可以说，这个反问句把我搞糊涂了。\n你的翻译“我们最终岂不必须安息在那与神真实声音相伴的‘神圣性质’（*to theion*）上吗？这性质能显明自己，并使人的灵魂确信到一个地步，排除一切错误的可能。” 我大概明白这里的意思，似乎是说，我们的信心需要安息在圣灵的工作里，“听”到那神真实的声音，因而完全可以确信。这是信心可安息的根基。但是读起来始终绕口。可以尝试再组织语言，让中文阅读者读起来，也更容易明白。",
          "status": "resolved",
          "createdAt": "2026-09-06T00:29:31.358Z",
          "resolvedAt": "2026-09-06T01:00:56.878Z"
        }
      ]
    },
